{"data":{"title":"Magic Stick","slug":"magic-stick","path":"/artists/neck-neck/tracks/magic-stick/","artwork":"images/artists/neck-neck/tracks/magic-stick.jpg","artist":{"id":"r_7qKAuWHTM","slug":"neck-neck","links":null,"title":"Neck Neck","artwork":null},"id":"D9EqyUai0gs"},"appearanceCount":1,"markers":[{"chapter":{"id":"UQKUtJsffKA","show":{"id":"cdnqQ9xehXc","slug":"195","title":"Soulection Radio Show #195","artwork":"/images/episodes/195.jpg","content":"Joe Kay continues the freestyle of all music. \n\n<!--more-->\nLast week's show was definitely one of my favorites to date. It's weird how things work. It's the shows that I feel most unprepared for that end up doing well... maybe it's because I just really freestyle and go off of my whole library of music rather than trying to curate a specific vibe. It was hard to top last week's show but I did my best to really take it right back to the early beat era from 2008-2012 and played some current gems as well. I hope you enjoy this. I'll be back next week with a guest maybe.\n\nBless.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","published_at":"2014-11-29T00:00:00+00:00"}}}],"linkedPlatforms":[{"id":65366,"platform":"tidal","href":"http://www.tidal.com/track/74569470","artwork":"https://resources.wimpmusic.com/images/ffacf813/d9b8/4846/87d3/4a1e00be1831/640x640.jpg","last_checked_at":"2020-01-24T17:49:20.607+00:00","track":"D9EqyUai0gs"},{"id":65365,"platform":"appleMusic","href":"https://music.apple.com/us/album/magic-stick/1242190776?i=1242190862&uo=4","artwork":"https://is5-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Music127/v4/de/c6/8b/dec68b0b-fcd3-e0f8-8046-3dee803a89f1/source/100x100bb.jpg","last_checked_at":"2020-01-24T17:49:22.764+00:00","track":"D9EqyUai0gs"},{"id":65367,"platform":"spotify","href":"https://open.spotify.com/track/3nyC83xn4ubcavIep4hNeE","artwork":"https://i.scdn.co/image/ab67616d0000b273eaa7c5de97e5d067fdc62e0b","last_checked_at":"2020-01-24T17